{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 14, :comments ["<b>Yissaschar is a strong-boned ass.</b> By way of the plain sense (peshat): he compared the tribe of Yissaschar to a strong ass, mighty of bone, in which the flesh is scant — so too the children of Yissaschar were refined in matter, lean of flesh, bearers of the yoke of Torah, like an ass that one loads with a burden. <br> <b>Couching between the saddlebags.</b> Like an ass that crouches and walks by day and by night and has no lodging in a house, and when it crouches, it crouches between the boundaries of the towns."], :book :genesis, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 49, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:21:30.366233614Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}